# ironclaw_curse.txt:6: the enchanted creature (Hill Giant 3/3, -0/-1 makes it
# 3/2) cannot block creatures with power equal to or greater than its
# toughness (ValidAttackerRelative$ Creature.powerGEIronclawX, X =
# Count$CardToughness of the enchanted blocker). Llanowar Elves have power 1,
# below 2, so the block is legal: the Elves die and the Giant takes 1.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
# One more advance for the state-based-action check that kills the Elves.
advance
